{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835630/extras/0477b2292e48ac29f90910ba5fc48132.avif?t=1769810924\" width=780 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A first-person, physics-driven platforming adventure where gravity has gone wrong and the sky itself is broken.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world pulled upward into chaos, your mission isn\u2019t just to climb \u2014 it\u2019s to survive, adapt, and ultimately seal the colossal portal tearing reality apart.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a vertical world filled with floating debris and derelict structures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull, stack, and reposition physics-based objects to forge paths through impossible spaces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental puzzles that test momentum, timing, and creativity.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progression</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and recycle trash to gain XP, unlock skills, and upgrade your toolkit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn new movement abilities \u2014 from dashes and double jumps to gliding \u2014 that transform how you explore.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3835630?t=1769810924","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3835630?t=1769810924","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835630/ebf5df8f742071be99f1a3b34a57aaee98010758/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769810924","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835630/ebf5df8f742071be99f1a3b34a57aaee98010758/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769810924","categories":[{"descriptio